      en: ["The Viqueque teak forests cover an area of about 300 square kilometers.", "Viqueque municipality has a population of about 70,000 (2015).", "Teak trees were first planted in the 1920s.", "Annual timber production is about 50,000 cubic meters.", "The average height of teak trees is 30 meters.", "Teak wood exports earn around 2 million USD per year."],
